# Scratch left in the working folder by the checks in .github/workflows/build.yml: the meshes and
# pages of the two-lines check, the books of the bind and unbind check, the rebuilt model, the
# copies of data/ used to test the lookup next to the executable, and the oracle's read-back of the
# example book. All of it is regenerated, and every pattern is anchored so that the committed
# fonts, meshes and images are kept.
